---
import Studio from "../../layouts/Studio.astro";
const beliefs = [
  ["Real audiences only", "No bots, no bought followers, no ghost views. If the number is not real, it is worth nothing to you."],
  ["Research before content", "We study the audience before we write a single hook, so the content is built on what people actually care about."],
  ["One team that learns your voice", "The same people plan, script, edit and post, so your content sounds like you and gets better every month."],
  ["Clear, honest reporting", "You always know what is working, what is not, and what we are changing next."],
];
---
<Studio title="About | Synchro Social" description="A social media studio founded in 2022, based in Miami, with a fully remote team in the US and LATAM." page="about">
  <section class="wrap hero">
    <h1>We help people with something to say get heard.</h1>
    <div class="hb"><p class="lede">Synchro Social is a social media studio founded in 2022. We're based in Miami, with a fully remote team in the US and LATAM.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap sec tight split">
    <img class="portrait" src="/images/apply4/kasper-founder.webp" alt="Kasper, founder of Synchro Social" />
    <div>
      <h2 class="sh">Why I started Synchro</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>I'd been working in social media for a few years when something started to bug me. The people with the most to teach, coaches, doctors, authors, founders who'd spent twenty years getting good at one thing, were basically invisible online. Meanwhile louder accounts with a lot less to say were everywhere.</p>
        <p>And it was never their message. They just didn't have the time to figure out who their audience was, turn what they know into videos people actually want to watch, and then keep doing it every single week. Honestly, almost nobody does.</p>
        <p>So in 2022 I started Synchro Social. The idea was simple: one team that learns how you talk, does the research, makes the content and tells you straight what's working. No bots, no bought followers, no numbers that look good and mean nothing.</p>
        <p>We're bigger now, and the team is spread across the US and Latin America, but that's still the whole job.</p>
        <p class="sig">Kasper, founder</p>
      </div>
      <div class="facts" style="margin-top:40px">
        <div><b>2022</b><span>founded</span></div>
        <div><b>Miami</b><span>home base</span></div>
        <div><b>US and LATAM</b><span>fully remote team</span></div>
        <div><b>People first</b><span>for clients and team</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="band"><div class="wrap sec">
    <h2 class="sh">What we believe</h2>
    <div class="bl">{beliefs.map(([t, p]) => <div><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></div>)}</div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="wrap stats" aria-label="Recognition" style="margin-bottom:120px">
    <div><b>1.2B</b><span>views generated for our clients</span></div>
    <div><b>8M</b><span>followers grown across platforms</span></div>
    <div class="award"><img src="/images/awards/european-agency-awards-2026-finalist-white.png" alt="European Agency Awards 2026" /><span>Finalist, Social Media Agency of the Year</span></div>
  </section>
</Studio>
<style is:global>
.prose .sig{font-weight:600;color:var(--fg)}
.bl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:var(--s5) var(--s6);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:var(--s4)}
.bl h3{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:8px}.bl p{color:var(--mute);max-width:46ch}
@media (max-width:820px){.bl{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:var(--s4)}}
</style>
